   ABSTRACT
 - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

        A Qt5-based desktop screenshot tool was analyzed end-to-end. All
        fourteen PRO membership features are gated by eleven purely local
        boolean/enum decision functions with no signature binding and no
        server-side authority. Cloud translation has no local model and is
        therefore redirected through a runtime-configurable {API_ENDPOINT}
        variable. The remote-config and auto-update channels are unsigned.

        All three attack surfaces were neutralized by a SINGLE proxy DLL
        (260 KB) while leaving the official binaries byte-for-byte pristine
        on disk - verified by SHA256.

